  "statuteText": "227-C:2 State Historic Preservation Office. –\n\nThe division of historical resources, department of natural and cultural resources established by RSA 12-A:10-l shall also be known as the state historic preservation office. The director, division of historical resources shall also be known as the state historic preservation officer."
